## Checklist for a new API-backed screen

- [ ] 1. EndPoints.kt — new constant
- [ ] 2. Request.kt + Response.kt in `model/domain/request/` and `model/domain/response/`
- [ ] 3. ApiServices.kt — new suspend function
- [ ] 4. ApiRepository.kt — new method; ApiRepositoryImpl.kt — implementation with Flow and NetworkResult
- [ ] 5. GetXxxUiStateUseCase.kt + XxxUiState.kt + XxxViewModel.kt + XxxScreen.kt + Route and graph registration

Always follow this 5-file structure and folder structure throughout Amibica Auto development.
